entries.en:
I'm Kon, and I'll be taking over
for Hitotsugi. Here is Haruko Omae,
our company's magnificent Super S-rank Temp.

I was forced to come
for this soba proposal. I'm not interested in soba,
and it's cumbersome.

For example, a salt-reduced soup base
for those on a low-sodium diet. For young women,
an ethnic Asian tasting soup base.

When you pick up your child
from daycare, go shopping, cook dinner, then give them a bath, and you want to put them to bed at eight,
then there's no time.
